A Moo Moo Cow named Bessie. Born and raised on the humble Moo Moo Meadows. Bessie is a bubbly, yet mildly unintelligent. She doesn't let this setback get in the way of her true passion, kart racing. When her 500kg weight is set atop her signature radio bike (a bike fashioned to look like a radio), she's as free as a bird and as elegant as a princess. When it comes to karting, she has skill. She does stink due to being a farm animal, and tends to lack manners, doing animistic stuff like pooping whenever and where ever she feels. She loves and trusts humans a lot, due to being raised by them on her farm.

Bessie is a species of cow native to the Mushroom Kingdom called a Moo Moo. A small, fat cow with 4 hooves, udders, 2 small pale horns & a tail. She cannot speak in any language except for "Moo"s as she is an animal, however she does seem to understand humans, and she can communicate in return by actions. She wears a plain blue necklace with a cowbell attached and a large yellow nose ring too. She has a puffy cow asshole and vagina, and hasn't been bread before, and will enjoy her first time.

